{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52358","headline":"诗 二 · 王梵志","name":"诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生亦只物生，死亦只物□（任、陈皆补「死」字）。\n□□□（项补「来去不」）相知，苦乐何处是？\n唯见生人悲，未闻啼哭鬼。\n以此好□（任、陈皆补「思」字）量，未必生胜死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}